  "game_version": "24087620",
  "author": "SuperCrumpets",
  "description": "Balance changes:\n\tRuses:\n\t\tStarting Ruse Cards 2->3\n\t\tBlitz 120s->90s\n\t\tTerror 120s -> 180s morale mult 0.75->0.65\n\t\tSpy 60s->120s\n\n\tRetreat speed mult 0.5->0.75\n\tAntiTank Base enabled in 1939\n\nEconomy:\n\tSupply Depot 18/30s->24/40s\n\nUnit Stats:\n\t\n\tRecon:\n\t\tDetection 400m->475m\n\t\tall paras\n\t\tall light/medium infantry\n\t\tStuart\n\t\tPanzer3\n\t\tCruisera13\n\t\tH39\n\t\tCarro Veloce&M11\n\t\tT26\n\t\tHa-go\n\n\tHealth:\n\t\tAll Fragile Bunkers 250hp->350hp\n\t\n\tproduction times:\n\t\tHeavy infantry 5s->8s\n\t\tGvardiya 1s->5s\n\t\tPershing&SuperPershing 20s->30s\n\t\tCromwell  10s->5s\n\t\tMatilda   15s->10s\n\t\tChurchill&AVRE 40s->15s\n\t\tHurricane 15s->10s\n\t\tA6M Zero  10s->15s\n\n\tspeeds:\n\t\tInfantry\n\t\t\tlight/medium 24/8  -> 28/12\n\t\t\tHeavy        28/12 -> 24/8\n\t\t\tLegionnaires 28/12 -> 28/12 Morale 300->400\n\t\t\tParas        24/12 -> 16/16\n\t\tA6M Zero 720->540 (41600->31200)\n\n\tResearch:\n\t\tSkink $50->0\n\t\tChi-Nu  $50->$25\n\t\tChi-Ri  $25->$50\n\t\t140mm Artillery UK $50->$0\n\t\tSusie $0->$25\n\t\n\tNo longer Upgrades:\n\t\tHeavy Infantry \n\t\tPak40 \n\t\tChaffee\n\t\tCromwell\n\t\t140mm Artillery UK\n\n\tWeapons:\n\t\tammoid 44914&44915\tSuperHeavy Guns AP Range 500m->525m\n\t\t17pdr & Pak40 At gun Tammoid44918-> 44914 80D/500m -> 120d/525m\n\t\tAnti Air Range 550m->600m\n\t\tarty vs armourDamage modifiers\n\t\t\tlv1 0.2   -> 0.25\n\t\t\tlv2 0.1   -> 0.15\n\t\t\tlv3 0.05   -> 0.10\n\t\t\tlv4 0.025  -> 0.05\n\t\t\tlv5 0.01  -> 0.025\n\n\t\nRusopedia:\n\n\tAll:\n\t\tSupply Depot $40->$50\n\t\tAdmin Building $100->$200\n\t\tSecondary HQ $50\n\t\t\n\n\tUSA:\n\t\tHQ:\n\t\t\tMG Nest $15\n\t\t\tAT Bunker $25\n\t\t\tAA Bunker $30\n\t\tBarracks $20\n\t\t\tWillys $10\n\t\t\tGI $4\n\t\t\tRangers $6\n\t\tArtillery Base $35\n\t\t\tBofors $10\n\t\t\tM16 $20\n\t\t\tM19 $30\n\t\t\tPriest $35\n\t\t\tM40 $60\n\t\tTank Base $30\n\t\t\tGreyhound $20\n\t\t\tStuart $15\n\t\t\tChaffee $20\n\t\t\tL